WEBVTT

00:00:16.727 --> 00:00:20.772
ITIUSUU HO yume '(GHGGTGFU you I18

00:00:20.856 --> 00:00:24.735
<i>genjitsumi nado nai kotoba</i>

00:00:24.818 --> 00:00:28.780
<i>soko ni yadoru mirai no katachi</i>

00:00:28.864 --> 00:00:38.248
<i>kasuka ni kagayaita hitomi ni</i>

00:00:40.459 --> 00:00:48.425
<i>guuzen mitai ni surechigau hibi tadotta</i>

00:00:48.508 --> 00:00:58.101
<i>deai ga hajimaru nani ka o madowasu kigen</i>

00:00:58.185 --> 00:01:02.606
<i>unmei ga waratte iru no? kikoeru</i>

00:01:02.689 --> 00:01:06.151
<i>kousa suru kietsu to itami</i>

00:01:06.234 --> 00:01:10.572
<i>ano hi tsugerareta koe ni kasumeru</i>

00:01:10.656 --> 00:01:14.201
<i>hyouri no tsuyosa o kakaeta</i>

00:01:14.284 --> 00:01:22.125
<i>ima wa tokenai wake o himo toite</i>

00:01:22.209 --> 00:01:32.719
<i>kaneta negai no sono saki e habataku</i>

00:02:14.928 --> 00:02:16.513
Illumination.

00:02:32.612 --> 00:02:34.698
She is late, indeed.

00:02:34.781 --> 00:02:36.408
Urgent matters.

00:02:36.491 --> 00:02:37.534
Still...

00:02:37.617 --> 00:02:42.581
These sudden late arrivals over
the past few weeks are odd, indeed.

00:02:53.717 --> 00:02:55.260
Welcome back.

00:02:55.344 --> 00:02:56.511
Anticipated return.

00:02:56.595 --> 00:02:58.055
I'm back.

00:02:59.639 --> 00:03:03.310
You have been returning
late recently, indeed.

00:03:03.393 --> 00:03:06.605
Discussion necessary.

00:03:06.688 --> 00:03:08.774
Things came up.

00:03:08.857 --> 00:03:11.151
What "things"?

00:03:11.234 --> 00:03:12.194
Ambiguous.

00:03:12.277 --> 00:03:16.573
Come, now. The front door is
no place for a lengthy discussion.

00:03:16.656 --> 00:03:20.702
She must first unload her things,
bathe, and cleanse herself.

00:03:20.786 --> 00:03:23.622
Dinnertime is near as well, is it not?

00:03:23.705 --> 00:03:25.916
Mm. I'll see you later.

00:03:40.889 --> 00:03:44.935
"Domicile"

00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:51.441
That is the situation, indeed.

00:03:51.525 --> 00:03:56.029
Afterward, she wouldn't give me a
straight answer however hard I pressed.

00:03:56.113 --> 00:03:58.073
Not even Flame of the--

00:03:59.116 --> 00:04:04.413
I mean, even friends I've spoken
to on the phone won't say anything.

00:04:04.496 --> 00:04:07.707
Oh, I see. Even Alas Toru-san?

00:04:19.678 --> 00:04:21.263
Are you worried?

00:04:22.806 --> 00:04:24.724
Yukari-san's such a studious girl.

00:04:24.808 --> 00:04:30.272
It's only natural to feel worried if
she's suddenly stopped talking to you.

00:04:30.355 --> 00:04:34.025
I've known her for almost
half a year now myself.

00:04:34.109 --> 00:04:37.696
I feel I have a good
understanding of her personality.

00:04:40.991 --> 00:04:45.120
Yukari-san doesn't strike
me as the type of girl

00:04:45.203 --> 00:04:49.624
to simply lie or keep
secrets for convenience's sake.

00:04:49.708 --> 00:04:50.959
Indeed.

00:04:51.042 --> 00:04:57.007
If so, then maybe her
secrecy signifies something.

00:05:01.011 --> 00:05:04.472
Perhaps you should sit back
and watch her for a while.

00:05:17.611 --> 00:05:21.531
If you're that worried,
you could try to ask in a more casual--

00:05:32.042 --> 00:05:36.129
As brilliant as her idea is, this is a bit...

00:05:36.213 --> 00:05:37.672
Tolerable compromise.

00:05:37.756 --> 00:05:43.845
Why can't I just ask her myself
instead of having to stalk her like this?

00:05:43.929 --> 00:05:46.139
That's what my mom suggested too.

00:05:46.223 --> 00:05:50.602
Heedless contact and discussion
would only harden her attitude

00:05:50.685 --> 00:05:52.812
and prove meaningless, indeed.

00:05:52.896 --> 00:05:56.399
We must be careful not
to let ourselves be detected.

00:05:56.483 --> 00:05:57.651
Intent focus.

00:05:57.734 --> 00:06:00.278
Oh, right.

00:06:00.362 --> 00:06:02.948
Has her attitude at
school changed at all?

00:06:03.031 --> 00:06:04.783
No, not really.

00:06:04.866 --> 00:06:09.412
Are you sure you
simply haven't noticed, indeed?

00:06:09.496 --> 00:06:11.414
I can't really say.

00:06:11.498 --> 00:06:14.751
Until you told me,
I never noticed Sha--

00:06:15.794 --> 00:06:20.674
I never noticed that she was
hiding anything or taking side trips.

00:06:20.757 --> 00:06:25.095
You saw yourself that we parted ways
today in the same place as always.

00:06:35.105 --> 00:06:36.564
See you later, Shana.

00:06:36.648 --> 00:06:38.024
Mm.

00:07:01.798 --> 00:07:06.386
That shows that she's
hiding it from me, too.

00:07:07.262 --> 00:07:08.763
Logical argument.

00:07:08.847 --> 00:07:13.226
The Missus must be correct after all, indeed...

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:19.941
But I don't think a few little
side trips are anything to worry...

00:07:20.025 --> 00:07:22.444
...about...

00:07:22.527 --> 00:07:24.237
"A few little"?

00:07:24.321 --> 00:07:27.449
Such aberrant behavior
can have fatal repercussions.

00:07:27.532 --> 00:07:29.117
Vulnerability.

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:31.536
Yes, I see your point.

00:07:31.619 --> 00:07:36.708
As this lifestyle has dulled
her attitude and preparedness,

00:07:36.791 --> 00:07:43.548
perhaps it is necessary to rethink
her role in this place, indeed.

00:07:43.631 --> 00:07:45.842
Rethink her role...?

00:07:47.302 --> 00:07:51.598
W-Wait, are you saying you're
going to make her quit school?!

00:07:51.681 --> 00:07:52.891
Indeed.

00:07:52.974 --> 00:07:57.812
I am sure there are many other ways
of protecting your Treasure, indeed.

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:01.024
You can't be serious...

00:08:01.107 --> 00:08:02.859
Enough idle talk.

00:08:02.942 --> 00:08:05.862
It's time to recommence the pursuit, indeed.

00:08:05.945 --> 00:08:07.322
Right.

00:08:08.782 --> 00:08:10.116
What is wrong, indeed?

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.160
Immediate response.

00:08:14.621 --> 00:08:17.540
Sorry. I lost her.

00:08:17.624 --> 00:08:23.713
So you did not fail to track her energy;
she purposely blocked it off herself?

00:08:23.797 --> 00:08:26.675
Yes. It suddenly cut out.

00:08:26.675 --> 00:08:27.467
"Sato"

00:08:27.467 --> 00:08:29.886
And this is the only
place where that could happen.

00:08:29.969 --> 00:08:32.680
That is sound reasoning, indeed.

00:08:34.015 --> 00:08:35.016
Yeah?

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:38.228
Margery-sank here, right?
We have something to ask her.

00:08:38.311 --> 00:08:42.273
Err, actually, she got wasted this
afternoon and said she'd execute me

00:08:42.357 --> 00:08:45.652
if I wake her up for anything
other than a Denizen showing up.

00:08:45.735 --> 00:08:48.488
Is this a really important emergency?

00:08:49.447 --> 00:08:50.657
It is, indeed.

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:52.534
Immediate discussion.

00:08:52.617 --> 00:08:54.494
Carmel-sen!

00:08:56.371 --> 00:08:57.330
--You have objections?

00:08:57.330 --> 00:08:59.124
--Interference pointless.
--You have objections?

00:09:04.546 --> 00:09:07.590
You've come this far;
why are you hesitant now, indeed?

00:09:07.674 --> 00:09:08.591
Come here...

00:09:08.675 --> 00:09:10.468
Judging from Sato's attitude,

00:09:10.552 --> 00:09:13.513
Margery-sank definitely
in on this whole thing too.

00:09:17.392 --> 00:09:21.479
Those two don't get along,
so they'd usually <i>never</i> work together.

00:09:21.563 --> 00:09:24.190
That shows how carefully they've prepared.

00:09:24.274 --> 00:09:29.362
It goes without saying that
they'll have planned for us coming here.

00:09:29.446 --> 00:09:34.367
Even if we do force a meeting,
she'll just give some sort of excuse or lie.

00:09:34.451 --> 00:09:36.995
It'd basically muck up
the whole investigation.

00:09:37.078 --> 00:09:39.289
So, rather than that...

00:09:52.302 --> 00:09:55.388
Nope, she's not showing up.

00:09:55.472 --> 00:10:00.643
It's only natural, given how carefully
she's concealing herself, indeed.

00:10:00.727 --> 00:10:02.312
Reference u n necessary.

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:05.064
Thank goodness...

00:10:06.983 --> 00:10:11.112
Oh, no, it's not actually good,
it's just, ever since the Tuning,

00:10:11.196 --> 00:10:14.741
there haven't really been
any other Torches besides me...

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:20.371
His words just now are free
of the relief of self-preservation,

00:10:20.455 --> 00:10:26.377
feelings of self-pity, animosity
for the world, and servile envy...

00:10:27.462 --> 00:10:30.298
Why does he seem this way?

00:10:30.381 --> 00:10:35.386
Could he have a peculiar
trait that, whether in peril or not,

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:39.390
keeps his true nature
separate from his emotions?

00:10:39.474 --> 00:10:42.185
That would make him
too slow and out of touch

00:10:42.268 --> 00:10:45.647
to deal with everyday
matters of an emotional nature.

00:10:45.730 --> 00:10:47.690
Premature conclusion.

00:10:49.692 --> 00:10:54.405
Yes, there's no
point in being hasty, indeed.

00:10:54.489 --> 00:10:55.824
<i>Carmehsan.</i>

00:10:55.907 --> 00:10:57.951
Could you display Unrestricted Methods?

00:10:58.034 --> 00:10:59.077
Even if she's hidden herself,

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:02.038
she can't hide where Unrestricted
Methods have been activated.

00:11:02.121 --> 00:11:04.207
I know that, indeed.

00:11:15.218 --> 00:11:18.555
Did Margery-san spread all these?

00:11:18.638 --> 00:11:21.057
It would seem so, indeed.

00:11:34.153 --> 00:11:38.157
I'll ask her again at school tomorrow.

00:11:38.241 --> 00:11:41.202
I really doubt she's up
to something bad, though.

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:46.541
I know it's a secret, but I'm sure
she can at least explain what's going on.

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:08.438
No, no, Sakai-kun!
You'll have to go home alone today!

00:12:08.521 --> 00:12:09.897
Huh?

00:12:10.398 --> 00:12:14.569
Shana-chan is coming shopping with us today!

00:12:14.652 --> 00:12:17.530
We already made plans. Sorry.

00:12:20.074 --> 00:12:21.451
Oh...

00:12:25.663 --> 00:12:27.582
So it's not just Sato and his group;

00:12:27.665 --> 00:12:31.669
Yoshida-san and Ogata-san
are working with Shana too?

00:12:31.753 --> 00:12:38.551
Could it be that they're all planning
a surprise party for Carmel-sanm?

00:12:38.635 --> 00:12:40.970
Then why won't they tell me?

00:12:41.054 --> 00:12:46.392
Do they think I'd spill the beans
if she tried to intimidate me?

00:12:46.476 --> 00:12:50.313
No, it's still not for certain that it's a party.

00:12:50.396 --> 00:12:51.522
Still...

00:12:51.606 --> 00:12:54.400
Oh? You even have to walk home alone?

00:12:54.484 --> 00:12:58.154
It feels like Shana-chan
has been avoiding you all day.

00:12:58.237 --> 00:13:01.532
I guess. I think she's trying to
keep something secret.

00:13:01.616 --> 00:13:04.911
Whenever I ask anyone,
they dodge my questions.

00:13:04.994 --> 00:13:07.789
You haven't heard anything, have you?

00:13:07.872 --> 00:13:13.753
Anything about, you know, a surprise
party for someone or something?

00:13:13.836 --> 00:13:15.088
--Good question.

00:13:15.088 --> 00:13:15.880
--Huh?
--Good question.

00:13:15.963 --> 00:13:22.720
If I was in on their secret, do you
really think I'd share it just like that?

00:13:22.804 --> 00:13:25.723
Who knows, I mightjust skirt the question

00:13:25.807 --> 00:13:29.644
and give Shana-chan's
side a thorough status report.

00:13:34.607 --> 00:13:40.321
I wish to know her purpose
for coming here, indeed.

00:13:40.405 --> 00:13:43.783
Purpose...? She's just here to shop, right?

00:13:43.866 --> 00:13:48.329
I already provide the necessary
provisions and household goods, indeed.

00:13:48.413 --> 00:13:50.289
Full furnishment.

00:13:52.917 --> 00:13:54.168
What is it, indeed?

00:13:54.252 --> 00:14:00.717
Oh, nothing. I just realized it was
just like this when I first met her.

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:03.720
I bet you wish she could go
back to how she was

00:14:03.803 --> 00:14:08.808
when she was just a simple
Flame Haze and nothing else, huh?

00:14:10.101 --> 00:14:13.229
Was she like that as a child too?

00:14:13.312 --> 00:14:14.856
Of course, indeed.

00:14:14.939 --> 00:14:18.484
She was extremely self-disciplined,
devoted to her duty,

00:14:18.568 --> 00:14:20.528
and ardently trained on a daily--

00:14:21.529 --> 00:14:23.656
That has nothing to do with this, indeed.

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:25.700
Prying useless.

00:14:29.746 --> 00:14:31.873
Oh, by the way, Carmel-sen...

00:14:31.956 --> 00:14:35.376
Those clothes... Don't you
think they're too conspicuous?

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:38.004
No, there's nothing wrong with it.

00:14:38.087 --> 00:14:41.132
I was just wondering if
you ever wear anything else...

00:14:41.215 --> 00:14:45.219
When I requested garb befitting
a noblewoman's caretaker,

00:14:45.303 --> 00:14:48.931
I was told this is the latest style, indeed.

00:14:49.015 --> 00:14:52.602
I continue to wear it after leaving
the Palace of Heaven's Road

00:14:52.685 --> 00:14:55.521
simply because of its superb functionality.

00:14:55.605 --> 00:14:57.523
When the two of you...

00:14:57.607 --> 00:15:03.446
I mean, when the four of you lived
together, did you ever get bored?

00:15:03.529 --> 00:15:05.615
Did you celebrate things like
New Year's or Obon?

00:15:05.698 --> 00:15:06.991
There were five of us, indeed.

00:15:07.075 --> 00:15:08.785
Oh? Really--

00:15:08.868 --> 00:15:11.746
Now be silent, indeed.

00:15:11.829 --> 00:15:12.830
Muzzled.

00:15:12.914 --> 00:15:14.290
Yes, Ma'am...

00:15:18.169 --> 00:15:19.587
--Is that all of it?

00:15:19.587 --> 00:15:22.048
--Yes, I think we're set now.
--Is that all of it?

00:15:22.131 --> 00:15:23.466
--Good luck, Shana-chan!

00:15:23.466 --> 00:15:25.009
--Mm. Thank you, you two!
--Good luck, Shana-chan!

00:15:25.092 --> 00:15:28.805
Was she really just tagging
along with them after all?

00:15:28.888 --> 00:15:30.348
--Well, see you later!

00:15:30.348 --> 00:15:31.891
--Yeah!
--Well, see you later!

00:15:31.974 --> 00:15:33.434
Carmel-sen!

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:38.815
You will be quiet, indeed.

00:15:38.898 --> 00:15:40.858
Repeated reprimand.

00:15:45.113 --> 00:15:49.075
We will trail from above and
pursue her visually this time, indeed.

00:16:00.837 --> 00:16:02.797
Why are you going to such lengths?

00:16:03.297 --> 00:16:05.550
Why are you going to such lengths?

00:16:05.925 --> 00:16:09.220
Deep down, you <i>do</i> trust her and all.

00:16:11.514 --> 00:16:17.478
You know she'd never disregard
her duty as a Flame Haze.

00:16:17.562 --> 00:16:20.523
So... why are you so persistent about this?

00:16:24.068 --> 00:16:25.153
--Regret.

00:16:25.153 --> 00:16:26.529
--Huh?
--Regret.

00:16:27.655 --> 00:16:29.532
Secrets lead to regret.

00:16:29.615 --> 00:16:33.995
I don't wish her to feel that foolish pain.

00:16:34.078 --> 00:16:38.207
Pain like I once felt for the Engaged Link...

00:16:43.004 --> 00:16:47.383
Do you think she's all right, indeed?

00:16:47.466 --> 00:16:53.639
I hope this secret, however trivial it
may be, isn't bringing her pain, indeed.

00:16:53.723 --> 00:16:55.516
Carmel-sen...

00:17:00.313 --> 00:17:05.318
To be honest, she's changed
a lot since I first met her.

00:17:05.401 --> 00:17:08.654
After living here, she's really...

00:17:13.492 --> 00:17:16.454
Yes. She's really grown a lot.

00:17:18.706 --> 00:17:24.337
I think it's because she's
discovered something in her feelings;

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:30.176
ones that might worry you
and ones that might not.

00:17:30.259 --> 00:17:33.304
I'm sure she's discovering more even now.

00:17:35.056 --> 00:17:36.849
Evening!

00:17:40.269 --> 00:17:43.981
I hear you dropped by
while I was asleep yesterday?

00:17:45.316 --> 00:17:47.193
--More like while you were plastered--

00:17:47.193 --> 00:17:49.820
--Shut up, stupid Marco!
--More like while you were plastered--

00:17:50.821 --> 00:17:53.574
Just what is going on, indeed?

00:17:53.658 --> 00:17:55.993
What do you mean?

00:17:57.286 --> 00:18:04.168
You, umm, gave her a bookmark or
something to hide her energy, didn't you?

00:18:04.251 --> 00:18:06.212
<i>Hmm'? u Her“ I?</i>

00:18:06.295 --> 00:18:07.213
Oof!

00:18:07.296 --> 00:18:10.549
Yep, she gave her one!
She wanted one!

00:18:10.633 --> 00:18:13.886
Apparently kids these days are
always tryin' to do stuff after school

00:18:13.970 --> 00:18:16.681
behind their parents' backs!

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:19.141
Banter unneeded.

00:18:19.225 --> 00:18:20.810
Why would you, of all people,

00:18:20.893 --> 00:18:23.771
lend a hand with something like this, indeed?

00:18:23.854 --> 00:18:28.818
I, of all people, want
to do this sort of thing now.

00:18:28.901 --> 00:18:34.198
Seriously, since when do you chew
people out over a measly bookmark?!

00:18:41.163 --> 00:18:42.999
Sorry! I'm late!

00:18:43.082 --> 00:18:44.125
Welcome back.

00:18:44.208 --> 00:18:46.669
Hurry, Shana-chan. We're running out of time.

00:18:46.752 --> 00:18:48.129
Right!

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:53.634
You trained an entire week for this day.

00:18:53.718 --> 00:18:56.637
We need to finish everything
before Carmel-san returns!

00:18:56.721 --> 00:18:59.265
Won't be much of a surprise party otherwise!

00:18:59.348 --> 00:19:00.725
Right!

00:19:01.892 --> 00:19:04.437
By the way, I know it's strange to ask now,

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:07.648
but what does today
commemorate for Carmel-sen?

00:19:07.732 --> 00:19:08.858
I don't know.

00:19:08.941 --> 00:19:12.486
But Wilhelmina kept saying
today is an important day.

00:19:12.570 --> 00:19:14.071
Is it her birthday?

00:19:14.155 --> 00:19:15.489
Possibly.

00:19:15.573 --> 00:19:18.451
I guess all that matters
is that it's an important day!

00:19:18.534 --> 00:19:19.702
Oh!

00:19:19.785 --> 00:19:21.287
What is it, Kazumi?

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:24.290
That... isn't hard flour.

00:19:25.291 --> 00:19:27.668
"Plain flour"

00:19:28.002 --> 00:19:31.756
Carmel-san. You know they're just
going to give us the run-around, right?

00:19:31.839 --> 00:19:36.802
We need to prove that they're
in on it so they can't play dumb.

00:19:36.886 --> 00:19:40.181
You will explain in clear detail later, indeed.

00:19:40.264 --> 00:19:41.640
Reluctance.

00:19:47.396 --> 00:19:49.190
Hey»!

00:19:56.155 --> 00:19:58.032
Yes? What's up?

00:19:58.115 --> 00:20:02.495
I'm sorry, Margery-san.
We made a bit of a shopping mistake.

00:20:02.578 --> 00:20:06.957
We need you to buy a little more time!
Fifteen minutes is all we ask!

00:20:08.876 --> 00:20:10.920
L-I can't!

00:20:11.003 --> 00:20:13.464
I can't buy time against
Carmel-san all by myself!

00:20:13.547 --> 00:20:17.218
Do it anyway.
Things are just starting to get good.

00:20:17.301 --> 00:20:19.095
But I can't--

00:20:23.933 --> 00:20:25.184
I thought so!

00:20:25.267 --> 00:20:29.688
You've been using me
to see where Carmel-san is!

00:20:31.357 --> 00:20:36.529
So, Tanaka keeps watch here
and reports to Shana and the others.

00:20:36.612 --> 00:20:39.865
And since Morn made me go with Carmel-sen,

00:20:39.949 --> 00:20:41.909
she's in cahoots with them too...

00:20:41.992 --> 00:20:44.078
I'm sorry, Yu-chan!

00:20:46.914 --> 00:20:50.918
This isn't cool.
Just what is everyone up to?

00:20:51.001 --> 00:20:53.754
Okay. I'll tell you everything...

00:20:53.838 --> 00:20:58.968
Yes. A cold wind blew through the
withered trees on that winter morn.

00:21:00.094 --> 00:21:03.973
I say withered "trees" because
all the trees in town were withered!

00:21:04.056 --> 00:21:06.225
All of them! Can you imagine that?!

00:21:06.225 --> 00:21:06.392
"Hard flour - 500 yen"

00:21:06.392 --> 00:21:10.604
That's how cold, how chillingly cold it was...

00:21:10.688 --> 00:21:16.318
Err, wait, perhaps it was on a sun-drenched
summer afternoon, actually!

00:21:16.402 --> 00:21:17.862
It was an especially hot day,

00:21:17.945 --> 00:21:20.906
which was why watermelon
was more delicious than usual!

00:21:21.615 --> 00:21:25.369
Or maybe it was a spring
evening, or an autumn morning,

00:21:25.452 --> 00:21:27.288
or maybe it was one late night
during the rainy season!

00:21:27.371 --> 00:21:30.207
It was then that Sato said to me,

00:21:30.291 --> 00:21:32.042
"Let's grab a bite to eat."

00:21:32.126 --> 00:21:35.629
It was then that I realized...
Yes! A bite to eat!

00:21:35.713 --> 00:21:39.049
And then I had croquette soba,
while Sato had a salmon chazuke

00:21:39.133 --> 00:21:40.384
and Oga-chan had...

00:21:40.467 --> 00:21:42.595
Oga-chan had rice with egg on top!

00:21:42.678 --> 00:21:43.345
--And then we--!

00:21:43.345 --> 00:21:45.347
--What is your point, indeed?
--And then we--!

00:21:45.431 --> 00:21:46.891
Immediate response.

00:21:46.974 --> 00:21:48.851
W-Well, uhh...

00:21:50.186 --> 00:21:51.770
We're back!

00:22:02.698 --> 00:22:06.285
I'm sorry about everything!

00:22:06.368 --> 00:22:10.456
Alastor-san and Big Sister will
explain everything to you now,

00:22:10.539 --> 00:22:14.001
so you're asked to walk
back to the Hirai family's house!

00:22:14.084 --> 00:22:15.127
<i>Master'?</i>

00:22:15.211 --> 00:22:16.086
--The Hirai household?

00:22:16.086 --> 00:22:17.963
“Suspicious intentions.
--The Hirai household?

00:22:19.506 --> 00:22:22.551
Tell them I'd like my little present.

00:22:24.929 --> 00:22:27.431
That was quite a wild goose chase, indeed.

00:22:32.728 --> 00:22:35.356
Hello, Carmel-sen!

00:22:35.439 --> 00:22:37.650
Yoshida-san? Ogata-san?

00:22:37.733 --> 00:22:40.152
Just what is happening, indeed?

00:22:40.236 --> 00:22:43.155
Just come inside where we can talk!

00:22:43.239 --> 00:22:45.616
You too, Sakai-kun!

00:22:54.917 --> 00:22:56.877
Welcome home!

00:22:59.255 --> 00:23:00.214
Sheesh.

00:23:00.297 --> 00:23:05.094
Keeping secrets from you is rough,
whether they're good or bad, y'know?

00:23:05.177 --> 00:23:07.304
So, once you became suspicious,

00:23:07.388 --> 00:23:11.141
our plan was to stick Yuji with you
so the others could keep tabs on you,

00:23:11.225 --> 00:23:14.645
and then, when the time
was right, you'd figure it all out.

00:23:16.105 --> 00:23:18.691
Well, I'm done here.

00:23:21.694 --> 00:23:25.281
I'm taking my payment now,
and Keisaku's too.

00:23:28.033 --> 00:23:31.579
Carmel-sen! Shana-chan worked really hard!

00:23:31.662 --> 00:23:33.998
She had Kazumi coach her like crazy!

00:23:34.081 --> 00:23:40.129
No, I only chose the ingredients
and made sure she didn't burn anything.

00:23:40.212 --> 00:23:42.089
Right, Shana-chan?

00:23:47.303 --> 00:23:50.848
Okay, I'm going to take
Tanaka's home with me.

00:23:50.931 --> 00:23:52.891
<i>I'll take Ike-kun's.</i>

00:23:52.975 --> 00:23:56.103
So Ike was in on it too...

00:23:56.186 --> 00:23:58.314
Come on. You should head home too.

00:23:58.397 --> 00:24:00.357
Huh? Me too?

00:24:01.609 --> 00:24:04.987
This is for your mother.

00:24:05.070 --> 00:24:06.447
Oh...

00:24:06.655 --> 00:24:08.991
Umm, Carmel-sen.

00:24:09.074 --> 00:24:11.702
That thing about her attending school...

00:24:12.995 --> 00:24:15.205
I don't know what you mean, indeed.

00:24:16.373 --> 00:24:17.833
Thank you!

00:24:22.963 --> 00:24:26.258
<i>Pannekoek, indeed?</i>

00:24:26.342 --> 00:24:27.718
Mm.

00:24:31.472 --> 00:24:33.057
Investigate motive.

00:24:37.728 --> 00:24:39.647
I wish to know why this scheme

00:24:39.730 --> 00:24:44.360
involved having the
Mystes accompany me, indeed.

00:24:44.443 --> 00:24:47.571
Should you really have
sent him home already, indeed?

00:24:47.654 --> 00:24:49.031
It's of no concern.

00:24:49.114 --> 00:24:52.409
In fact, being left unaware
is in his best interest.

00:24:55.412 --> 00:25:01.710
We felt it was important for you
and Yuji to finally get on good terms.

00:25:01.794 --> 00:25:05.089
In preparation for any
future perils that face us.

00:25:05.172 --> 00:25:08.092
We were of the shared
opinion that it was necessary

00:25:08.175 --> 00:25:12.388
to ferment the minimum amount
of mutual trust between you.

00:25:12.471 --> 00:25:15.724
How does Yuji Sakai seem to you now?

00:25:20.938 --> 00:25:23.732
He is a strange boy, indeed.

00:25:26.193 --> 00:25:27.903
That's good enough, then.

00:25:27.986 --> 00:25:30.114
Now eat up, Wilhelmina!

00:25:46.338 --> 00:25:47.715
How is it?

00:25:52.761 --> 00:25:54.721
Delicious, indeed.

00:25:56.432 --> 00:25:58.225
Food envy.

00:26:03.689 --> 00:26:05.190
Say, Wilhelmina!

00:26:05.274 --> 00:26:07.860
I was talking with
Kazumi about it earlier and...

00:26:07.943 --> 00:26:11.905
What day is today, anyway?
You said it was important, but...

00:26:14.742 --> 00:26:17.870
You remembered, indeed?

00:26:17.953 --> 00:26:19.163
Mm!

00:26:19.246 --> 00:26:21.039
After all...

00:26:47.900 --> 00:26:50.486
Hey, Wilhelmina!

00:26:50.569 --> 00:26:53.739
Are there any other days
you want to write down?

00:26:57.367 --> 00:26:58.744
Mm!

00:27:25.395 --> 00:27:32.694
Today... is the day you came to us, indeed.

00:27:39.785 --> 00:27:45.791
Yuzurenakatta om oi idaki

00:27:45.874 --> 00:27:51.880
<i>sore demo koko made aruite kita</i>

00:27:51.964 --> 00:27:59.429
<i>susumete nai you de toki
no nami ni hakobareta</i>

00:27:59.513 --> 00:28:05.352
<i>negai ni sukoshi fureta</i>

00:28:05.435 --> 00:28:11.608
<i>tooi kioku o tadoru</i>

00:28:11.692 --> 00:28:21.994
<i>"kou ja nakatta" koto de
kagayaiteta ki ga shite</i>

00:28:22.077 --> 00:28:29.626
<i>mabushikatta ano hi o koe</i>

00:28:29.710 --> 00:28:31.920
<i>ima koko ni iru</i>

00:28:32.004 --> 00:28:41.930
<i>owari toka hajimari toka
doko demo nai kono basho de</i>

00:28:42.014 --> 00:28:44.308
<i>kore kara bokura</i>

00:28:44.391 --> 00:28:56.278
<i>mata aruki arata na yume
mitsuke dasu koto darou</i>
